* Morpho Vault V2
** Architecture
*** Immutable ERC-4626 vault
*** Idle assets + adapters
*** Adapters report realAssets
*** Registries restrict adapters
** Roles
*** Owner: appoints
*** Curator: configures
*** Allocators: move funds
*** Sentinels: reduce risk
** Timelocks
*** submit, then anyone executes
*** Per-selector delay
*** Decrease costs its own delay
*** abdicate = permanent
** Ids and caps
*** Adapter, collateral, market ids
*** Absolute cap
*** Relative cap vs firstTotalAssets
*** Checked on allocate only
left side
** Accounting
*** Once per transaction
*** Gains capped by maxRate
*** Losses immediate
*** Performance fee <= 50%
*** Management fee <= 5%/year
** Exits
*** withdraw: idle, then liquidity adapter
*** forceDeallocate: penalty <= 2%
*** In-kind redemption via flash loan
** Gates
*** receive / send shares
*** receive / send assets
** Losses
*** Bad debt lowers realAssets
*** burnShares (timelocked)
*** Reverting adapter blocks accrual
@endmindmap
